1
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,680
The one and only President Wen is back.

2
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,660
Congratulations.

3
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,930
Who would have thought?

4
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,970
Just three months ago,

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,060
you were half-dead in a hospital bed,

6
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:31,380
and now you're the president of Wen Group.

7
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,250
And getting married too.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,200
It's only been three months,

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,610
and you're getting married again.

10
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:41,050
Mr. Alex is really something.

11
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,710
He managed to help my daughter move on

12
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:45,110
from her last relationship so quickly.

13
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,600
The boss of Cloudsea truly
lives up to his reputation.

14
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:52,330
Shouldn't I be thanking you, Mom?

15
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,280
You helped me get rid of the trash,

16
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,030
so I could make room

17
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,670
for the right person.

18
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:04,910
On such a happy day,

19
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:07,440
let me give you a gift too.

20
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,460
Did you know?

21
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:20,840
Jiang Yu is the son of

22
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:22,940
your husband's first love

23
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:26,710
After all the twists and turns,

24
00:01:26,789 --> 00:01:29,070
her son and I ended up together.

25
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:32,630
I am scared that one day,
after all those twists and turns,

26
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:36,270
Dad will end up with his first love again.

27
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,690
[Dearest: Episode 9]

28
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:42,680
Dad.

29
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:44,480
You're here.

30
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,780
I never thought that Alex,

31
00:02:47,780 --> 00:02:50,540
the person I had been

32
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,390
trying so hard to meet,

33
00:02:51,390 --> 00:02:53,520
would turn out to be my biological son.

34
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:54,560
Dad.

35
00:02:55,430 --> 00:02:57,090
You've been away for too long.

36
00:02:58,050 --> 00:02:59,050
You don't know me,

37
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,060
and I can understand that.

38
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,890
You understand?

39
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:13,260
You've made me a laughingstock
in the entire business world.

40
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:14,890
Do you know how many years it took me

41
00:03:14,890 --> 00:03:16,750
to establish myself in Wen Group?

42
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,090
And now look what's happened.

43
00:03:18,090 --> 00:03:20,290
Not only have I lost my seat on the board,

44
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:21,880
but that old man Wen Yanhui

45
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,350
even wants to throw me out.

46
00:03:24,390 --> 00:03:26,310
I've worked so hard for so many years,

47
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:27,750
and you ruined it all.

48
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:32,910
I accepted you
because we share the same blood.

49
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:34,630
I treated you as my own son,

50
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,190
but you teamed up
with that wench Wen Jianan

51
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,710
to humiliate me.

52
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:42,680
Dad.

53
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:45,300
Everything I did was for you.

54
00:03:46,050 --> 00:03:47,640
I am your biological son.

55
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,800
If I marry the Wen family's granddaughter,

56
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:54,930
wouldn't that make the Wen family
part of the He family?

57
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,000
Don't be anxious.

58
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,950
The Xingji project

59
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:02,750
was my offering to Wen Yanhui,
a show of good faith.

60
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,360
If I had told you in advance,

61
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:07,310
could you have played your part well?

62
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:10,190
Wouldn't Wen Yanhui have seen through it?

63
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:17,290
Is that really what you think?

64
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:23,950
Does it hurt?

65
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,270
No.

66
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:28,670
Dad,

67
00:04:29,670 --> 00:04:31,310
if I ever do anything wrong,

68
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:33,720
you can always set me straight.

69
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:38,560
Don't blame me.

70
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,200
I was just acting on impulse.

71
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:43,290
I only understand your good intentions now.

72
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,680
Are you willing to join hands with me

73
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:48,070
to take down the Wen family?

74
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,950
Congratulations on your marriage.

75
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,550
I'll wait for your good news.

76
00:05:36,650 --> 00:05:38,050
Get some men ready for me.

77
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,159
I will turn their wedding

78
00:05:40,630 --> 00:05:42,159
into their funeral.

79
00:05:44,670 --> 00:05:47,280
Jiang Yu, you are my own flesh and blood,

80
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:48,510
yet you want me dead.

81
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:51,880
Then don't blame me
for sending you to your grave.

82
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,420
Have someone keep a close eye on He Mu.

83
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:59,020
I want to know his every move.

84
00:05:59,020 --> 00:05:59,940
Yes, Boss.

85
00:05:59,970 --> 00:06:01,500
I'll arrange it right away.

86
00:06:13,730 --> 00:06:16,500
Mrs. Wen, this is my car,

87
00:06:16,530 --> 00:06:17,650
not a taxi.

88
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:21,900
Isn't Cloudsea supposed to
offer top-notch service?

89
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:25,530
Then surely driving a guest home
is only to be expected.

90
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,350
Besides,

91
00:06:27,930 --> 00:06:30,400
I'm your fiancée's mother.

92
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:37,370
You are Jiang Yuqing's son.

93
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,450
So you are only with Wen Jianan

94
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:42,720
to get revenge on her, aren't you?

95
00:06:43,310 --> 00:06:44,560
I can help you.

96
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,430
Mrs. Wen.

97
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:50,050
You know the relationship
between my mother and He Mu.

98
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:52,180
Wouldn't you want to kill me even more?

99
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:55,830
Before that,

100
00:06:58,690 --> 00:07:00,320
of course I also want to

101
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:03,060
cooperate with you.

102
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,720
Stop the car.

103
00:07:18,910 --> 00:07:20,560
I don't like being someone else's pawn.

104
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,890
Mind your own business.

105
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:44,810
I made this myself
using Icelandic volcanic stone.

106
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:47,280
There are only two in the world.

107
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,850
Why does Alex have this ring?

108
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:55,750
Could he be involved in Chenghan's death?

109
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,270
It's been 45 days.

110
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:03,670
The baby is very healthy.

111
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,000
Honey.

112
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:10,340
Look, is that his head?

113
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,720
Why can't I see it?

114
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,240
It's right there.

115
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:15,710
Is it there?

116
00:08:15,730 --> 00:08:16,460
Yes.

117
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,280
Who are you? Get out.

118
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,860
Pull yourself together.

119
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:34,860
You have to live on for him.

120
00:08:39,049 --> 00:08:41,500
I will love you in his place.

121
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:31,040
He Mu just beat me up today.

122
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:33,870
He went to see you?

123
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:36,790
Are you okay?

124
00:09:37,850 --> 00:09:39,210
So you do care about me.

125
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:43,360
Of course.

126
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,600
We are partners, aren't we?

127
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,410
What happens to our plan

128
00:09:48,550 --> 00:09:50,150
if something happens to you?

129
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,390
Besides,

130
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:55,030
nice abs.

131
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,240
Don't worry.

132
00:10:00,170 --> 00:10:03,410
Everything is going according to plan.

133
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:08,010
The look He Mu gives me is already
filled with murderous intent.

134
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:10,340
I know people in the underworld.
So does he.

135
00:10:10,340 --> 00:10:12,740
He is planning to strike at the wedding.

136
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,890
Looks like our plan worked.

137
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:20,720
We could never find

138
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,480
evidence of his previous murders,

139
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:25,120
so we had to use ourselves as bait,

140
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,780
force him to kill again,
and create new evidence

141
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:31,230
to completely bring him down.

142
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:34,440
Avenging my mother is my business.

143
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,360
Are you sure you want to get involved?

144
00:10:37,610 --> 00:10:39,010
If you want to quit now,

145
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,330
I won't stop you.

146
00:10:51,990 --> 00:10:53,260
Don't talk. Kiss me.

147
00:11:35,170 --> 00:11:36,830
As for your question just now,

148
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,800
this is the answer.

149
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,030
I think

150
00:11:48,870 --> 00:11:50,870
we are in the same boat now.
